<title>SOUTH KOREA: Korea Zinc '96 zinc output up yr on yr.</title>
<headline>Korea Zinc '96 zinc output up yr on yr.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Korea Zinc Co Ltd, South Korea's largest zinc and lead producer, on Friday said its zinc production rose 3.2 percent to 196,000 tonnes in 1996 from 190,000 tonnes in the previous year.</p>
<p>The company's lead output fell 24.6 percent to 89,000 tonnes in 1996 from 118,000 tonnes a year earlier, an executive official told Reuters.</p>
<p>The official declined to give the reason why its lead production fell significantly last year.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
